cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Byte-Interval Mediation: Read-Receipt Write Admission for Concurrent LLM Coding Agents"
abstract: >-
  A byte authority that records durable read receipts over exact byte
  intervals and admits a file write only when the bytes it replaces, and
  everything its author read, are still current. Standalone extraction of the
  ToolsEnabled engine component, with its test suites, design probes and
  recorded results.
